	   <h2>Official description</h2> 
	      <div id="description-wrapper" class="description-wrapper">
        <div id="description-content" class="description-content" data-nosnippet>	 
            Easily download videos and music directly from the Internet to your device. All formats are supported. 100% free!<br><br>Nowadays, watching and downloading videos is becoming an increasingly popular user need, but today&#39;s websites use advertising excessively and prevent users from being able to easily watch and download videos from other websites&#39; web pages.<br><br>Free Video Downloader detects videos automatically, you can download them with just one click. The powerful download manager lets you pause and resume downloads, download in the background, and download multiple files simultaneously. Use HD video downloader to preview videos in advance, fast download and play offline.<br><br>Important features:<br>- High speed download<br>- With one tap, you can download recordings automatically and quickly<br>- Supports all formats, mp3, m4a, mp4, m4v, mov, avi, wmv, doc, xls, pdf, txt, etc<br>- Download in background mode<br>- Play offline, download vmate private fast browser 2024<br>- From all social media networks, you can download HD recordings and social media clips<br>- Allow users to hide or show downloaded videos in albums<br>- SD card support for downloading files<br><br>How to use the app:<br>- Search or directly enter the website address you need to download<br>- Watch Videos as usual in the browser<br>- The app will recognize the video automatically and you can choose to Download or Play the video online<br>- Enjoy the app!<br><br>Disclaimer:<br>- This app does not support downloading from YouTube due to terms of service.<br>- Please respect the copyrights of others, any unauthorized actions (uploading or downloading content) and/or violations of intellectual property rights are the user&#39;s own responsibility.<br>- All trademarks (including logos, names and badges) are the property of the owner companies. We do not allow other applications to copy or mislead users.<br>- The prohibition on downloading and watching videos protected by copyright is regulated by the laws of the country where you live. We are not responsible for any violation or misuse of any social network.<br>- Private or restricted videos cannot be downloaded using this app.			        </div>
		<p class="source-note">Source: Official app description retrieved from <a href="https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.videosaver.videodownloader.story.saver&hl=en" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener noreferrer">Google Play</a>. Provided for reference only.</p>	
